#
# Failing control for math:TensorAxisIndexNonNegativeConstraint: the one axis of a
# rank-1 shape declares index -1. One axis under rank 1 satisfies the count and
# presence laws, -1 is below the rank so the upper index bound holds, and a single
# axis cannot repeat an index; the negative index is the only defect.
# Bound by ex:ecTensorAxisIndexNegative.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/tensor-shape-controls/> .

ex:shape a math:TensorShape ; math:tensorRank 1 ; math:shapeAxis ex:axis .
ex:axis a math:TensorAxis ; math:axisIndex -1 .
